      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The woolly wrangler makes a whip Strike. On a hit, the woolly wrangler can either knock the target Prone or pull it up to 5 feet. If the creature ends this movement adjacent to the wrangler's mount, the mount can make a melee unarmed Strike against the creature as a free action."
