  "text": "When a giant, dangerous animal is found, there's always someone who tries to pet it. A woolly wrangler is usually accompanied by an Elephant or Mammoth. They can Command this Animal without needing to succeed at a Nature check.\n\n---\nExplorers are often well-equipped and well-trained for any type of hazard and are eager to lead others into the wild."
